{"c":[{"id":"1b02788402b8b346","sum":"storage_compatibility_version, even latest: 2nd plain in-process connect: ConnectionException. v1.0.0 stays v1.0.0+; 1.5.4 reads+writes. ce16489 no nanobind. SQL immutable; 0003 as shipped; no unrun version. INSTALL/LOAD vss, no autoload; kill after 0003: no vss; 0009 drops index","tree":{"c":[{"id":"63ba1e5d1c252753","sum":"2.0.0: explicit storage_compatibility_version (even latest) raises ConnectionException on a second plain in-process connect. v1.0.0 at v2.0.0 stays v1.0.0+; 1.5.4 reads and writes it. plain 489 MiB, zstd 290 MiB; ILIKE 142/196 ms; sum(length) 27/97 ms; 50 rows 3 ms; copy 5.3 s.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261023T001340Z-ee4e725d1cf8c7b2","text":"DuckDB 2.0.0, measured 2026-10-22: any explicit storage_compatibility_version (even 'latest') makes a plain connect to the same path in the same process raise ConnectionException. A v1.0.0 file opened with 'v2.0.0' keeps v1.0.0+; 1.5.4 still reads and writes it.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T001341Z-996aef6d584dc9d1","text":"Live tables copied 2026-10-22 into v2.0.0 files: plain 489 MiB (text Uncompressed), zstd on text+tool_input 290 MiB. ILIKE over text 142 vs 196 ms, sum(length(text)) 27 vs 97 ms, latest 50 rows 3 ms both. Copy 5.3 s both.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"888f9caf1291b966","sum":"Puck ce16489 exited 0: make sync, no --with; copy stayed v1.0.0+; 1.5.4 wrote; no nanobind. Released SQL is immutable; 0003 returns shipped; no runner records a version unrun. 2.0.0: 0003 needs INSTALL/LOAD vss, no autoload; kill after 0003 reopens without vss; 0009 drops index.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261023T010854Z-5c910d697bfc5d76","text":"Puck shadow of constrain-size-as-best-we-can at ce16489 (fresh clone, make sync, no --with) exited 0: every phase passed, copy stayed v1.0.0+, DuckDB 1.5.4 wrote it, no nanobind line.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T012807Z-7941fa66d7075fa2","text":"Operator 2026-10-22: released migrations are never rewritten; 0003 returns as shipped. No runner rule may record a version unrun. DuckDB 2.0.0: released 0003 needs explicit INSTALL/LOAD vss (no autoload); a kill after 0003 reopens without vss and 0009 drops the index.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"4b8f31e9a70ffcd2","sum":"SQL immutable, comments OK, ci strips vs tag. 2.0.0 no vss: CHECKPOINT after ALTER/INSERT/CREATE VIEW on HNSW fatal; close. 0004-0009 reach 9. New warehouse renamed under flock, not hard-linked. 3-8: 1.5.4 vss. No view-SQL compare (v1 fewer parens); table SQL+constraints match.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"176e1e47f3b7f3ae","sum":"comments may change (#128 @rel, 0001+0007); SQL must not. make ci compares comments-stripped SQL to the latest tag. 2.0.0 no vss, HNSW: CHECKPOINT after ALTER, INSERT, or CREATE VIEW: FatalException; close checkpoints. 0004-0009, mid-chain kill, tiny checkpoint_threshold reach 9.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261023T040809Z-c22f9b609db9aad0","text":"Operator 2026-10-22: a released migration may gain or change comments (#128 added @rel lines to 0001 and 0007); its SQL may never change to do something materially different. A make ci/CI gate compares released migrations' SQL, comments stripped, to the latest tag.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T042410Z-e369216e79b70d78","text":"DuckDB 2.0.0 without vss, file with the HNSW index (2026-10-22): explicit CHECKPOINT after ALTER, INSERT, or CREATE VIEW raises FatalException (Cannot bind index); a plain close checkpoints fine. Runner 0004-0009, a kill mid-chain, tiny checkpoint_threshold: all reach 9.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"906dad0df1fa4bd0","sum":"New warehouse is renamed into place under the writer flock, not hard-linked, so new installs need no hard links. Schema 3-8 tests use DuckDB 1.5.4 vss files. v1.0.0 view SQL has one fewer closing paren than v2.0.0; do not compare view SQL text. Table SQL and constraints match.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261023T141155Z-466f715437dd59f5","text":"Operator 2026-10-23: a new warehouse is built at a temp name and renamed into place after a check under the writer flock, not hard-linked, so new installs need no hard links. Schema 3-8 migrate tests use files written by DuckDB 1.5.4 and its vss.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T143437Z-5511efe16b6ad9f6","text":"DuckDB 2.0.0, measured 2026-10-23: a v1.0.0 file reloads view SQL (duckdb_views().sql) with one fewer closing paren than memory or a v2.0.0 file shows for the same view; table SQL and constraints match. A v1.0.0-vs-v2.0.0 catalog check must not compare view SQL text.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
